{"id": "EUVD-2026-97594", "enisaUuid": "f9d28367-2161-3a10-906f-c37cac95221a", "description": "Open WebUI from 0.6.27 before 0.11.4 contains an information disclosure vulnerability that allows destination servers to obtain user session cookies by receiving the full browser cookie jar on OAuth-mode connections. Operators of OpenAI-compatible connections, OpenAPI tool servers or terminal servers can capture forwarded session cookies from routine requests and replay them to hijack accounts, including administrators.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:04:52", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T02:40:17", "baseScore": 7.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-gqfh-jxvw-74rp", "https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/f9f815c86220f809fad5ee1300c44f55dea74c79", "https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/b71744b17823f7a3a9a64cb363e79a7164ed5b23", "https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/3cda47cdb449aac970426f0929c9e5f8bb8bd807", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/open-webui-0.6.27-before-0.11.4-session-token-disclosure-via-oauth-mode-connections"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109292", "GHSA-crcq-c44m-c92x"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.32, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "55201e33-ae47-33e3-aa07-5ed0fed3ecbb", "product": {"name": "open-webui", "vendor": {"name": "open-webui"}}, "product_version": "0.6.27 <0.11.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "cb800843-b4e9-3c9e-a8cb-21bcd646beda", "vendor": {"name": "open-webui"}}], "isExploited": false}